// Q-007 quillo check counts only the main file's functions and components
// mode: check
// open-when: /ok \(1 routes, 0 functions, 0 components\)/
// fixed-when: /1 functions, 1 components/
// From FEEDBACK.md §4 (found on f1695a3).

use "lib/parts.qwe"

route GET / = <html><body><Counter/>{double(2)}</body></html>
